---
import VersionSwitcher from '../components/VersionSwitcher.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`} />
	<title>Brand — aito</title>
	<style>
		body { background:#0a0a0b; color:#e7e7ea; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 2rem; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.65; }
		h1, h2 { color: #ff5b2e; }
		.swatch { width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:6px; display:inline-block; margin-right:12px; vertical-align:middle; border:1px solid #222; }
		code { background:#111; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<VersionSwitcher />
	<h1>Brand</h1>
	<p><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}`}>← Editor</a> · <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}hub/`}>Hub</a></p>

	<h2>Logo</h2>
	<p>The primary mark is a minimal geometric frame with internal lines + the wordmark “aito”.</p>
	<img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}logo.svg`} alt="aito logo" style="max-width:420px; margin:1rem 0; background:#111; padding:20px; border-radius:8px;" />

	<h2>Colors</h2>
	<div>
		<div class="swatch" style="background:#0a0a0b"></div> <code>--bg: #0a0a0b</code><br><br>
		<div class="swatch" style="background:#e7e7ea"></div> <code>--fg: #e7e7ea</code><br><br>
		<div class="swatch" style="background:#ff5b2e"></div> <code>--accent: #ff5b2e</code><br><br>
		<div class="swatch" style="background:#8a8a93"></div> <code>--muted: #8a8a93</code>
	</div>

	<h2>Typography</h2>
	<p>Primary: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, “SF Pro Display”, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif</p>
	<p style="font-size:1.6rem; letter-spacing:-0.03em;">High-end, quiet, precise. Avoid heavy weights except for emphasis.</p>

	<h2>Voice</h2>
	<p>Minimal. Confident. No hype. We speak like the best tools in the room — Capture One, Resolve, but quieter and more modern.</p>
	<p>“AI that actually helps.” “Built for the way you actually work.”</p>

	<h2>Usage</h2>
	<p>Do not stretch the logo. Keep generous breathing room. On dark backgrounds the mark uses the orange gradient. On light backgrounds use the dark version.</p>

	<p style="margin-top:3rem; font-size:0.9rem; color:#666;">
		Full brand assets and Figma file available on request.
	</p>
</body>
</html>
